 "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_1426662262769612_6311685057863124741_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Aln8syrl4rsQ7kNvwHpwlHC&_nc_oc=AdqpYb1yRImRmGOHMg_DLCkJestULN2b7OSJuRs6GgBTWDXuNclXeWteTIU_y8PBoAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNsRFG9fXltFkr2nosViHwvjjYr3RJGJUx3HgVHQe2VkA&oe=6ADF5BDE"}, {"file_name": "logo-transparent.png", "id": "1161989966167586", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_1161989969500919_329693315265702608_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tgFjXrg8uI0Q7kNvwE4SfcN&_nc_oc=AdoVkXYK8R2btElv-D6-MGSbJquZQft3KFSR8HUk1x-cOEuGqgI8bjylhEUVnVkbWqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM5fo1rzwJZIPsxcMbU_Br0_FQ_DGwXJpQzAoNRudbU_Q&oe=6ADF726F"}]}, "id": "1114189757747469", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01.png", "id": "2907512559608947", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312231_2907512562942280_4790508338452449229_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CDSs9AQCUuMQ7kNvwHRzDy-&_nc_oc=AdpKzcMj_w_Nm2GhZE8p9AYsqVkC5M9_kEkd3YoQktnAW6pmv9Wk-d7-q-ppYyB2fRs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPVfF872-1NLoKr3qdlOZKI-nwftL6al2MywPr8w-mQeg&oe=6ADF6E3C"}, {"file_name": "02.png", "id": "1114877094450423", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312267_1114877097783756_969857562965461489_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dRq--ZprO3cQ7kNvwHVMGvu&_nc_oc=AdquzSgltpW94-6de735sF4sQ46yvMkqTxET0SKVNB_6-wXG1xAJgI1kZ_s1gws03ZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMPjjO0xEf05LgLCVFDBqFMUbe_hOEohruJHgReE45l6A&oe=6ADF6AF5"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "884131511361956", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314659_884131514695289_5808890142641071213_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hUTSFfsrBhkQ7kNvwEHzpYg&_nc_oc=Adr2vaPtWGskwW9ZmItnpJWQPJkQGYs5L8WG5Mw8cK_OntUZWPPvEyoy50MRJFDej6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOLlIE60Atyv3cIRVJunccU89kcELFZLfeUrvWqKWRmGQ&oe=6ADF4999"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "2073705526623799", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313063_2073705529957132_5967704642211820566_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SMZzYS4_pyUQ7kNvwGM2zu7&_nc_oc=Adrczqabw1bTawNB24vMpmV-HSCPTAfml6OvxkbxvL2GTOmNLvF3k1p77PgfilDuTJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPeTNy7XtN7YlWjMA4xVv7_7LEu62JOTxZpGbjrDh-98Q&oe=6ADF6665"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "1110048894841244", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1110048898174577_7636723964820635014_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j-wZE0AbFJoQ7kNvwEe4_4R&_nc_oc=Adp2CKjeZ9i0HSMLWkSw_6woIzOMFpzxbxHvBTTlXT09gi3GTv6iEBjIymz0oMoq15U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPmgnMYBs6fnMqYYVttUh_YEMrmaX36qJYxa0ff3YdfCA&oe=6ADF648E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Immuch360", "keywords": ["360", "video", "VR180", "Immich", "player"], "long_description": "Your media. Any screen. Every perspective.\n\nPress 360\u00b0 on a 360\u00b0 photo or video and it is all around you: look around by turning your head. 3D files, top and bottom or side by side, are in true 3D, VR180 fills a half sphere, and an Apple spatial photo floats in front of you in 3D. Flat photos and videos play in the window, with your whole library.\n\nControls: the right thumbstick turns the view by 30 degrees, the left one goes to the previous or next media, the trigger plays or pauses, A or X shows the panel with the time bar and the 3D and 360\u00b0/180\u00b0 buttons, B or Y goes back to the window. Hands work too.\n\nYour files where they are, nothing copied: the headset's own photos and videos (\"Use without a server\", no account), SMB, WebDAV and DLNA shares found on your network, a phone or a computer shared on the Wi-Fi, a Plex Media Server without plex.tv, or your Immich server. Raw files of Insta360, GoPro MAX and DJI Osmo 360 cameras are stitched in the headset.\n\nGood to know: tested on a Quest 3. HEVC is the safe codec; on a Quest 3, H.264 stops around 4096x2304, and the app offers the server's transcoded stream when an original is too large.\n\nThe same app runs on phones, tablets, TVs and computers. Free and open source (GNU AGPL v3), no ads, no analytics, nothing sent to the developer.\n\nImmuch360 is an unofficial fork of the Immich mobile app. Immuch360 is not affiliated with nor endorsed by Immich, FUTO, Plex, Meta, Apple, Google, Insta360, GoPro, DJI or TP-Link.", "short_description": "Your photos and videos all around you: 360\u00b0 and VR180 in true 3D, panoramas, and your flat photos and videos too. Played in place from the headset, a NAS, a media server, a Plex server, a phone or a computer at home, or your Immich server. Raw 360\u00b0 camera files are stitched in the headset. Free and open source, no account needed."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360/blob/immuch360/PRIVACY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "APROGSYS", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360/issues", "website_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "de", "es", "it", "pt_BR